1. PREAMBLE
The Cluaiz Systems License (CSL) is designed to foster a high-performance, collaborative ecosystem. It ensures that the Cluaiz Infrastructure remains accessible to individuals and contributors while requiring fair commercial participation from large-scale entities.

2. THE THREE-TIER USAGE MODEL

A. Free Individual Usage
- Eligibility: Individuals, students, researchers, and entities with an annual revenue/valuation below $10M USD.
- Rights: Free use, modification, and integration into your projects (including commercial apps).
- Requirement: Must include the original Cluaiz copyright notice.

B. Contributor Commercial Waiver
- Eligibility: Active core contributors to the Cluaiz ecosystem.
- The Waiver: Validated contributors are granted a Full Commercial Waiver, bypassing the $1M threshold for profit-based use of the core infrastructure.
- Requirement: Contributions must be merged into the official repository.

C. Enterprise Commercial Mandate
- Eligibility: Entities or parent companies with revenue/valuation exceeding $10M USD.
- Requirement: Must obtain a separate Commercial Agreement or fulfill the requirement through strategic partnerships (compute, funding, or hardware access).

3. PROTECTIVE COVENANTS (THE LOCK & INSTA-KILL)
- Trade Secret Status: The AtmaSteer Protocol, Engine C Mathematical Logic, and Silicon Probing Signatures are hereby defined as Trade Secrets of Cluaiz Technologies. Protection extends beyond copyright into intellectual property and proprietary mathematical logic.
- No Architectural Cloning: Copying, reverse-engineering, or reimplementing the 3-Tier Silicon-First architecture for competing works is strictly prohibited.
- The "Insta-Kill" Clause: Any violation of these covenants results in the Automatic and Immediate Termination of all rights granted under this license. Unauthorized use post-termination shall be prosecuted to the fullest extent of the law.
- No Unauthorized SaaS: Managed service or API offerings of Cluaiz that compete with official offerings require an Enterprise Agreement.

4. AUDIT & COMPLIANCE
Cluaiz reserves the right to request a self-declaration of revenue or usage audits from commercial entities to ensure compliance with the $1M USD threshold.

5. NO WARRANTY & LIMITATION OF LIABILITY
The software is provided "as is". Cluaiz is not liable for any damages arising from the use of this engine.

6. GOVERNING LAW, ARBITRATION & JURISDICTION
- Governing Law: This license shall be governed by the laws of India.
- International Arbitration: All disputes arising from this license shall be settled by binding Arbitration in New Delhi, India.
- Final Legal Venue: While arbitration is the primary dispute resolution mechanism, the Final Legal Jurisdiction remains exclusively with the courts in Prayagraj, Uttar Pradesh, India.

"Architecture is Sovereignty. Logic is a Trade Secret."